{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id301953969"}, "name":{"label":"Mateo Teo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-24T22:49:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.9"}, "id":{"label":"12352263181"}, "title":{"label":"This is the one"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve used countless different apps, both popular and lowkey, to manage tasks in my personal life but this is the one that I’ve finally settled on. It has pretty much all the main features that I look for and without being too flashy or needlessly complex. \n\nSuggestion: Instead of just the normal strike-through bullets used to track tasks, I would love to see numbered lists added. I like attacking tasks in specific order and having that added visual would be dope.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"9"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id213650296"}, "name":{"label":"Trusted Opinions"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-22T19:29:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.9"}, "id":{"label":"12343972680"}, "title":{"label":"Unprecedented"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tried every todo list app on the App Store, and I swear things 3 is the best. The app is so buttery smooth, it’s addicting to use. Everything about this app is so well thought out. And I must say: the app icon design, particular in dark mode, is the best *ever*", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id24508879"}, "name":{"label":"Whatdidmarksay"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-21T20:13:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.9"}, "id":{"label":"12339960291"}, "title":{"label":"Add “Get Things” on your to-do list!"}, "content":{"label":"After trying out the top three task managers, it was Things that won me over most. For one, the minimalist design is gorgeous. Integration with Apple Calendar is wonderful. If you live in an Apple ecosystem and don’t have to contend with Windows or Android, I think you’ll wonder how you got along with it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1757118852"}, "name":{"label":"ChillPill4Phil"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-18T11:37:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.9"}, "id":{"label":"12326827591"}, "title":{"label":"Good enough to make me glad I left Android"}, "content":{"label":"There is a bit of a learning curve to this app, but it’s so worth it.  The UI has *so* many thoughtful touches in it.  This app is not the reason I switched to iOS, but it might make me buy a Mac laptop.  D*mmit.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1695914210"}, "name":{"label":"Veggie 07"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-13T04:29:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.9"}, "id":{"label":"12305739793"}, "title":{"label":"Color font"}, "content":{"label":"So far, it’s wonderful, but I would love to see a way to add different color fonts to make it pop. For example, \"IMPORTANT: CALL THE DOCTOR\" in red so it stands out more. Thank you!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id26558167"}, "name":{"label":"Sun-mar"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-12T07:20:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.9"}, "id":{"label":"12302464505"}, "title":{"label":"Simple yet effective"}, "content":{"label":"I have been using Things for years and I love how it focuses on a few guided folders like the “upcoming”, “today” etc. I would love to see an option to add images sometime in the future. Overall, fantastic task management tool!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1147773366"}, "name":{"label":"Mxc2025"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-02T14:05:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.8"}, "id":{"label":"12263286649"}, "title":{"label":"Getting me through grad school"}, "content":{"label":"I started using this in the fall and have not looked back. It is a great way to keep my classes/ homework, research tasks, and personal lists all in one place. Being able to schedule when to dos appear on certain days is a game changer. I love having all my lists in one place. I use this in conjunction with google calendar. I was able to sync the calendar so I can also view events. 100% worth the one-time investment for the phone and Mac app!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"5"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"11"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id26491885"}, "name":{"label":"Mingaming"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-27T09:04:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.8"}, "id":{"label":"12237772638"}, "title":{"label":"Longtime User"}, "content":{"label":"I love the app. The thing that would take it over the top for me would be the ability to add colors. It would really make it come alive, and add a whole new layer of organization. Please consider this!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id209169951"}, "name":{"label":"Kan12235"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-25T22:22:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.8"}, "id":{"label":"12231896420"}, "title":{"label":"Probably the most thoughtful to do app"}, "content":{"label":"Been with Things since 2018. Originally I switched from Omnifocus, since I wanted something simpler. I have tried so many other tools since but always came back\nTo Things. The standout features for me are the way due dates and defer dates are handles as well as the possibility to assign dates to projects. The UI is just so clean.\nMy only criticism is the way tags can be viewed on my iPhone -\nSome more\nPowerful filtering would be helpful.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
