{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id201795819"}, "name":{"label":"robertginkgo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-11T13:42:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.7"}, "id":{"label":"12172895001"}, "title":{"label":"Great App, Minimal Support"}, "content":{"label":"I was considering coming back to Things 3 after a Year on Todoist, but was disappointed to see that there’s been no features introduced in that time beyond bug fixes during that time. There are known “areas for growth” in Things’s feature set: collaboration, file attachment being foremost among them.   I do prefer Things 3’s UI and Project/Area architecture over Todoist’s, and I’ve already purchased on all platforms. Cultured Code, please step up your feature updates.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1254144618"}, "name":{"label":"purasrvng"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-09T19:45:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.6"}, "id":{"label":"12165706171"}, "title":{"label":"Best $10 I’ve Invested In Myself"}, "content":{"label":"I’ll keep it short.\n\nI’m 23 and recently broke into a fairly large company, this transition has been quite hectic from a task management perspective. \n\nThis app seriously helps me more than anything else! \n\nMinimal UI/UX creates a great environment to get done what you need to get done.\n\nThanks to the dev team on this truly.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id114368714"}, "name":{"label":"Rogers📝"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-09T12:33:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.6"}, "id":{"label":"12164586811"}, "title":{"label":"Great Minus 1 Thing"}, "content":{"label":"Have been using this app for quite sometime UI & reliability is great. BUT ONE thing that I can’t understand is why after 5 or 6 yrs why can’t we check off reoccurring task/ checklists ahead of schedule. It’s beyond disappointing!!!!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
