{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id936997742"}, "name":{"label":"Wobblin17"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-29T16:32:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.6"}, "id":{"label":"12121626654"}, "title":{"label":"Not syncing properly to Apple Watch?"}, "content":{"label":"Love the app so far, only issue is after syncing to my Apple Watch I was able to see my tasks, but when I marked them complete, those tasks still show in the watch face widget.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1499200204"}, "name":{"label":"C.R.Cunningham"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-29T02:56:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.6"}, "id":{"label":"12119208402"}, "title":{"label":"Still haven’t figured it out"}, "content":{"label":"The tutorial is vague to say the least. I’m still confused on how everything is categorized and how and when I will receive reminders, possibly a comprehensive calendar or some sort of “it’s all here and sorted and organized etc”. So frustrating so I never use it. Paid like 40 bucks and never use it. 🤦‍♀️", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id324334370"}, "name":{"label":"B.Beccss"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-26T21:47:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.6"}, "id":{"label":"12110484624"}, "title":{"label":"Create app, minor glitch"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using this app for over five years and I honestly love it!\n\nThere is one minor glitch going on right now. Whenever I have a repeating project, and I add those to dos to my daily to do list, they appear significantly out of order. Could you please fix this?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1414093526"}, "name":{"label":"zJakkies"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-24T18:04:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.21.6"}, "id":{"label":"12102286751"}, "title":{"label":"Great Application"}, "content":{"label":"I really appreciate everything this app has to offer. Everything is structured and I’ve achieved so much in my life already from using it. \n\nAn awesome feature to add on in the future would be photos, or Icons. Maybe even a notion collab or integration. Anyways. Thank you to the team at Things 3. You’re doing great.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
